{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的感受提示缺少 X 那种随音乐具体段落逐点出现的细腻变化，音乐与情绪的即时对应关系有所减弱。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 左右分区明确，人物叙述和音乐感受各有位置，扫屏时容易建立整体印象；完整的因果句也让人理解他从怕添负担、试探亲近，到逐渐接纳自己的喜欢，最后接受无法保证未来的心理过程。X 的重点加亮和定时出现的感受更有利于抓关键词、体会音乐细节，但部分感受过于密集、重复，容易让观众忙于阅读而忽略人物故事。综合来看，Y 更容易让没有读过原文的普通观众听懂并跟住整段情感发展。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6dd93223-9ed0-4549-9688-95c7a23c32ac", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T070700557634Z", "elapsed_seconds": 141.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:09:22.270683+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64c6eb39129c1ecbbc35075be0c45c358ef321f2be07ec63146e847d9304bb64", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a